        ],
        "text": "(Watchman's house.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s064-u002",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "வாட்ச்மேன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s064-d001",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 81,
            "printedPage": 73
          }
        ],
        "text": "Why do you keep grieving, amma! Be happy, amma!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s064-u003",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குமுதா",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s064-d002",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 81,
            "printedPage": 73
          }
        ],
        "text": "What happiness is there for me! When I think that I have come under your shelter only to become another burden......",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s064-u004",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "வாட்ச்மேன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s064-d003",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 81,
            "printedPage": 73
          }
        ],
        "text": "Never mind, amma... What's that to worry about! You can stay right here until your husband comes back from jail. Who else do I have? You're like my own daughter!........",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s064-u005",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குமுதா",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s064-d004",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 81,
            "printedPage": 73
          }
        ],
        "text": "I can never forget your help!......",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s064-u006",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "வாட்ச்மேன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s064-d005",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 81,
            "printedPage": 73
          }
        ],
        "text": "All right, take care, amma! I'll go to the hospital and come back.",
        "notes": []
      }
    ]
  }
}
